---
// Figma 1022:57232 "col-main" (partner strona): the deal's display-lg title and its body (the
// default slot, set in `Prose`), a hairline, the shared "Tagi" list and the shared "Sitemap" trail.
import Sitemap from '../sitemap/index.astro'
import TagList from '../tag-list/index.astro'
import type { DealInfoProps } from './types'

type Props = DealInfoProps

const { title, tagsLabel, sitemapLabel, idPrefix, tags, crumbs } = Astro.props
---

<article class="deal-info" aria-labelledby={title ? `${idPrefix}-title` : undefined}>
  <div class="deal-info__body">
    {title && <h1 id={`${idPrefix}-title`}>{title}</h1>}
    <slot />
  </div>
  <hr />
  {tags.length > 0 && <TagList label={tagsLabel} labelId={`${idPrefix}-tags-label`} tags={tags} />}
  <Sitemap label={sitemapLabel} labelId={`${idPrefix}-sitemap-label`} crumbs={crumbs} />
</article>

<style>
  /* 1022:57232 "col-main" (32px side padding, 64px bottom) → 1022:57233 "wrap" (gap 31). */
  .deal-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 31px; /* token-lint-ignore: Figma wrap gap 31, no token */
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0 var(--space-32) var(--space-64);
  }

  .deal-info__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-16);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font: var(--type-display-lg);
    font-stretch: var(--display-stretch);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    text-transform: var(--text-case);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* Figma "Line 9": a 0-height line whose 1px stroke sits just above its box. */
  hr {
    height: 1px;
    margin: -1px 0 0;
    border: 0;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  /* Single column: the text lines up with the tiles above and below it. */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .deal-info {
      padding: 0 0 var(--space-32);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    h1 {
      font: var(--type-display-md);
      font-stretch: var(--display-stretch);
    }
  }
</style>
